  "title": "Honey Garlic Chicken Wings",
  "description": "Marinating the chicken wings overnight in a mixture of honey, soy sauce, brown sugar, and mustard powder gives these oven-baked appetizer favorites plenty of flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "malcriada"
  ],
